  "accessibility": "- The root is a `<nav class=\"breadcrumb\">` with `aria-label=\"breadcrumbs\"`.\n- Each breadcrumb item should be an `<li>` with an `<a>` or `<span>`, and the final active item should have the `is-active` class.\n- **The current page:** `is-active` (with your class prefix, if you set one) only styles the item, so put `aria-current=\"page\"` on its `<a>` or `<span>` too, as the examples do. A screen reader then says which crumb is the page you're on. Without it, every crumb reads as just another link.\n- **Icons beside text:** leave an icon beside a crumb's text without an `ariaLabel`, so it's hidden from assistive technology and the link's name is its text. A label on it is read as part of the link (\"home icon Home\").",
  "related": ["Icon", "useBulmaClasses"],
  "storybook": "https://bestax.io/storybook/?path=/story/components-breadcrumb--default",
